      "writtenOn": "2020-05-29T22:37:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This function needs to be in the HOOKS task. Merging it in system_common_shutdown() makes it in the same CHIPSET task. This is a deadlock: waits for the power_state change but it also blocks the power_state change.",
      "parentUuid": "87d23135_f4e4beaf",
